<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Windows on MarkJacobsen.net</title><link>https://markjacobsen.net/tags/windows/</link><description>Recent content in Windows on MarkJacobsen.net</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:12:30 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://markjacobsen.net/tags/windows/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Move Windows with Keyboard Shortcuts</title><link>https://markjacobsen.net/2026/07/move-windows-with-keyboard-shortcuts/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 10:12:30 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://markjacobsen.net/2026/07/move-windows-with-keyboard-shortcuts/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Sometimes it&amp;rsquo;s the little things that make all the difference. Like being today years old when I learned the keyboard shortcut to move a Window between monitors. Simply use &lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Shift&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Left/Right Arrow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And since we&amp;rsquo;re on the topic, here are a few other favorites:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Shortcut&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Meaning&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Home&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Minimize all except active window&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;m&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Minimize all Windows&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;d&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Toggle Min/Max all Windows to get to the Desktop&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Down Arrow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Restore down or minimize&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Win&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Up Arrow&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Maximize&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Alt&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Tab&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Switch between open applications (Also &lt;code&gt;Alt&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Shift&lt;/code&gt;+&lt;code&gt;Tab&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>